{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An old-school style strategy-driven FPS where you explore diverse maps and fight weirdly shaped creatures alongside your robot companion.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore and wreak havoc on diverse, old-school-style maps\u2014each presenting its own unique challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources carefully; you can never have enough ammo. Master a blood-based energy system: dominating enemies grants you power to swing a giant sword, repair your robot friend, and wield powerful weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master your companion\u2019s abilities too \u2014 use fruit to encourage them. Your sentry\u2019s fighting style evolves based on your choices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your progress anytime with an old-school style save system.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3803760?t=1769145549","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803760/0ef2b4a7c3099cb3927823581cabea7a65df6eb7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769145549","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803760/8daad3121ba41a98a9d84650b05f61645ed7ed76/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769145549","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3803760/8daad3121ba41a98a9d84650b05f61645ed7ed76/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769145549","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3963970,"descri